From: Yaw diagnostic field session (issue #13)
Subject: [Fix 1] ekf.yaml local — raise yaw process noise 0.01 -> 0.1

Effect: P[5,5] grows faster between updates, so IMU yaw measurements
get more Kalman weight relative to wheel-derived vyaw integration.

Apply with:    git apply docs/yaw_diag_patches/fix1_yaw_process_noise.patch
Revert with:   git apply -R docs/yaw_diag_patches/fix1_yaw_process_noise.patch

Only apply AFTER Test A (5 m straight drive) confirms IMU is the
trustworthy yaw source. If Test A shows IMU itself is biased, do NOT
apply this fix — switch to Fix 4 (Xsens profile) instead.

---
